SUMMARY:TDRR #8 Weekend Short Ride\, Churchtown ACS (18F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Cindy Herr\n\nCele
 brate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to the
  event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Riding 
 our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose Page]
 (https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR Sched
 ule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-cvhs-churchtown-ride/)\n\nTour de Red Rose & LBC
  Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and Wea
 ther Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/la
 ncasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets are
  mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repai
 r kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetup Me
 mber does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your 
 agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.cl
 ubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and
  [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?pag
 e_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154401
 87/
