SUMMARY:FUN RIDE - CV Church St ACS 18F RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: Volunteer to Sweep\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mp
 h\nRoute: [CV Church St ACS 18F](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/
 cv-cvhs-churchtown-ride/)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\
 nWithout a volunteer leader\, this event is Show and Go.\nThe departure lo
 cation AND THE ROUTE are the same as the Tour de Red Rose\, just an hour l
 ater\, so there will be other cyclists to help but on a different route.\n
 If you want to volunteer to lead\, leave a comment for this ride\, or cont
 act Rick Zook.\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader will ride at th
 e advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-
 drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep t
 he group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multip
 le groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride i
 f you are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No
  earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lev
 ers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper w
 aiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this 
 ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Memb
 er Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_
 id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Con
 duct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pag
 e_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs
 : [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22
 &club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154876
 81/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260630T182758Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630T182758Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
